   - Arrival curve: `alpha_f(t) = l_f + (l_f / P_f) * t`
   - Service curve: `beta(t) = idleSlope * [t - c_max / idleSlope]^+`
   - WCD: `D_f = sum of per-hop delays + 2 µs per hop`.

